From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] bcmdhd: adapt more of the driver to Linux 7.3

Replace removed timers/random helpers and legacy kernel_read,
PCI DMA and cfg80211 notification call sites. This is not the
complete port; the remaining cfg80211 wireless_dev and station
info changes are described in HANDOFF.md.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
